  "text": {
    "en": {
      "text": "Scoring multiple Hits on targets Exhausts them. Triggering it on Players makes them deal 10% less damage.\n\nExhaust duration cannot be refreshed.\n\nHit Requirements by Weapon Type:\n• 3 Hits: Bows, Glaives (both Projectile and Melee), Grenade/Rocket Launchers (Impact and Detonation damage count separately), Sniper Rifles\n• 7 Hits: Scout Rifles\n• 12 Hits: Sidearms\n• 13 Hits: Submachine Guns\n• 14 Hits: Fusion Rifles\n• 16 Hits: Auto Rifles",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-27T22:16:48.137Z",
      "updatedBy": "Hawkmoona"
    }
  },
